From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yugidraft <yugidraft@localhost>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] core: keep removed chain cards out of eliminated seats

Clear removed cards from leave_confirmed during elimination. SolveChain must not send these cards to the Graveyard after the seat leaves. The elimination function does nothing with two seats.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UrYy4jjEcbJHKdcVYasfdb
---
 field.cpp | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/field.cpp b/field.cpp
index a08099f..a8cde72 100644
--- a/field.cpp
+++ b/field.cpp
@@ -248,6 +248,10 @@ void field::eliminate(uint8_t p, uint8_t reason, bool marked) {
 	}
 	send_remove_cards(pduel, locs);
 	for(auto& pcard : order) {
+		// A removed card cannot leave again when SolveChain clears activated cards.
+		// This function only runs at n > 2; keep the stock two-seat chain cleanup.
+		core.leave_confirmed.erase(pcard);
+		pcard->set_status(STATUS_LEAVE_CONFIRMED, FALSE);
 		if(pcard->overlay_target)
 			pcard->overlay_target->xyz_remove(pcard);
 		else {
